purpose operation heapAllocCapability "Authority to allocate per-request auth JSON and token scratch buffers."
capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to release per-request auth JSON and token scratch buffers."
capability memoryBufferReadWriteCapability memory.buffer readWrite
purpose operation memoryBufferReadWriteCapability "Authority to read parsed auth buffers, compare bearer strings, and wipe password scratch memory."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to read parsed auth JSON document cursors."
capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to create and destroy per-request auth JSON documents."
